source: ASF Jira Server 8.20.10, POST /rest/api/1.0/render (hack/jira-render-evidence.py), captured 2026-08-24
observed: A blank line ends the table even while a row is open: Jira renders one data cell holding `a` and a forced newline, and reads `b|` as a paragraph below the table.
-- input.jira --
||h||
|a\\

b|
